 AMD is paying more than $8 billion to acquire Fei-Fei Li's World Labs, and Li will join the chipmaker as chief scientist. (Bloomberg) Anthropic had a net loss of $42 billion for 2025 and plans to spend more than $500 billion on computing in the coming years, according to a version of the company's IPO prospectus seen by Reuters. SpaceX's next-generation Starship rocket came back to Earth earlier than planned yesterday, with an explosion visible on the company's livestream. (Axios) Some of the world's foremost AI researchers and policy leaders — including at OpenAI, Anthropic and Microsoft — are sounding fresh warnings about RSI. (Axios) A coalition of unions, AI companies and private equity firms are banding together to make the case for responsible growth in seven key states. (Axios) 
 
